<title>UK: RTZ pressured as SBC Warburg cuts forecasts.</title>
<headline>RTZ pressured as SBC Warburg cuts forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in UK metals and mining group RTZ Plc weakened on Wednesday after brokerage SBC Warburg Securities cut its earnings estimates for the company.</p>
<p>RTZ shares were down 13p or 1.36 percent at 937-1/2p by 1011 GMT with just over two million shares traded while the overall market was down 0.23 percent.</p>
<p>Market sources said SBC Warburg had revised its earnings forecasts slightly lower but declined to give further details.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
